{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1fa00cb016e1fd62b94e8e92ab8279cf92401f5dfe84afb56b4251f0e20b4ab", "ja": "（ACT公演のポスター撮影が終わった。普段の奈緒と\nガラッと変わった雰囲気でいい感じに仕上がりそうだ）", "zh": "（ACT公演的海报拍摄结束了。和平时的奈绪截然不同的氛围，感觉会拍得很不错）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "12236af688278bdcf8f6f1bb396ca944e8b32de2414ea601192fcba3e8140b4b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n私の撮影、どうでした？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n我的拍摄怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a4286a7bd6f5c17fcb6651ee68a75b54e42a2ff670a03ec29f3994833b739939", "ja": "お疲れさま、奈緒！　いい感じだったよ。\nこの分ならステージも、心配なさそうだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，奈绪！感觉很不错哦。\n照这个状态来看，舞台也不用担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "53cfe5b5042f1eee11f0cfdc3ebc0b39990a0b8b35b999d5fcbba761968a378b", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪\nえへへ、稽古の成果が出たんかな。", "zh": "谢谢♪\n嘿嘿，看来排练的成果体现出来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "822546fb122b4b838ed718eda46bb088fd085ee62f3a4a6d555afd4c966acf49", "ja": "今回の舞台って、私の役が主人公なんですよね？\nこう見えても、プレッシャー感じてるんです！", "zh": "这次的舞台剧，我饰演的角色是主角，对吧？\n别看我这样，其实我也感到压力很大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ad6d1f8315610f636dd52ad2a4710ea46f8131d6d15c37ea594684b0ce085592", "ja": "そうだな。群像劇ではあるけど、\n間違いなくキーパーソンではあるし。", "zh": "没错。虽然是群像剧，\n但你毫无疑问是关键人物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c1668f3fc756f17c5c4f43af47035690339efb59cfb27e1cfc582feef9ee6178", "ja": "影を滲ませつつ、皆のお姉さん的な役割り……\n奈緒にとって、新しい挑戦かもな。", "zh": "带着几分阴郁色彩，同时又扮演着大家的大姐姐角色……\n对奈绪来说，说不定会是一次全新的挑战呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "a67eaa6886001b01cb403c3969a12816fe58da6eda30264051284d011685efec", "ja": "せやな～。「影がある」と「皆のお姉さん」て\n言われて、どうしたらええん！？って思いましたもん。", "zh": "是啊～被人说“很有神秘感”，还说我是“大家的姐姐”，我当时就想，这可怎么办才好啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "b74819c2ef904f5f30a01fb19c3f3fb62151e8fef45ab38eec678da95d50b6a2", "ja": "お姉さんやろうとすると、顔がニコニコしてしまうし。\n笑わんようにするんが大変で……。", "zh": "想要扮演大姐姐，脸就会不由自主地笑起来。要忍住不笑可真不容易……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d589518a80345c93640f13aa7c616b64fc680fb2f2c8ee4084d024ddea10f84c", "ja": "確かに難しいオーダーだな……\nでも、ちゃんとお姉さんに見えてたよ。", "zh": "确实是个难度不小的要求啊……\n不过，你看起来确实像个大姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "9efe747d8abe0d636bd82ed0caa731eb0bc58c9e68580bd44af6507974d73ce9", "ja": "環とかひなたが、私のことメッチャ慕ってくれてん。\nおかげで、お姉さんっぽく見えたと思うわ。", "zh": "小环和日向特别仰慕我呢。\n多亏了她们，我觉得自己看起来挺像个姐姐的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "61c825c7d86c07e8cdbafeb41c3fcfdf666b171d760f54295ea8512bee0f7ead", "ja": "あ、その点、このみさんはちゃいますね。見た目は\nカワイイけど、しっかりお姉さんっていうか……。", "zh": "啊，不过这一点上，木实姐就不一样了。虽然看起来很可爱，但确实很有大姐姐的感觉，应该说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5bbeffebd4fdc1272cd8ad35db64fb9234e4ba0301f5743413151d4750a88326", "ja": "そうだな。でも奈緒のお姉さん役、\nいい感じにできてたと思うぞ。", "zh": "是啊。不过奈绪的姐姐角色，我觉得你演得很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "b5426d0352f699abb60f0087401a2656efc83f198e27d9e4c8c7e3cd64be808e", "ja": "ほんまですか？　公演を観に来てくれる人達も、\nそう思ってくれたらええな～。", "zh": "真的吗？要是来看演出的人也能这么想就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "e5385af045789f5d273d84c4c8a72455bade857d080a57d5162f56efb47b810c", "ja": "そしたら、ドラマとか映画とか、\n主演女優のオファーが来るかもしれませんし！", "zh": "那样的话，说不定还会有电视剧或电影的女主角邀约找上门来呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8cf551b7265291cb3a6da818d27f4b762fc94b40b0e8688d9586ace94e9edd24", "ja": "そうだな！　期待してるよ。", "zh": "是啊！我很期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0263_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0263_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "40c6db3900f11b8a8fec83dd1726446082d376672575c4af29d68f9f60b6e1ad", "ja": "任せてください！　{$P$}さんと\n話してたら、自信ついてきたわ。えへへ♪", "zh": "交给我吧！和{$P$}先生聊着聊着，我越来越有自信了。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
